  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">China-United Kingdom Joint Square Kilometer Array Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK-China Square Kilometre Array Researcher Exchange Scheme to build capacity in China by training early career researchers in the use of the Square Kilometre Array as well as in data processing.</narrative>
  </description>
